{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In ADRIFT you find yourself behind the wheel, in the middle of nowhere, in possession of only one goal - deliver the Energy Core. Why, where and how are but questions that dance in your mind.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">YOUR TRUCK</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Set out in your off-road truck as you drift through winding canyons, accelerate along sand dunes, and handbrake turn your way through rocky plains in a world which has been lost to time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903570/extras/Adrift_Drift.gif?t=1744826303\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">YOUR CARGO</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tick-tock, tick-tock, tick-tock. Make sure to explore and plan your route before racing to your next safe haven. Every second the mysterious Energy Core spends in the desert heat is a second closer to your doom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903570/extras/Adrift_Checkpoint.gif?t=1744826303\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A THOUSAND JOURNEYS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the serenity of a long-forgotten desert, discover what happened to this land, craft shortcuts, and plot your own route through a top-down vaporwave-inspired world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903570/extras/Adrift_Path.gif?t=1744826303\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2903570?t=1744826303","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903570/cca02aed850e14a7f2dbacde1782f964e6d668cd/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744826303","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903570/954b1b2aba353d426b0eaf26436e43312b35e804/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744826303","capsule_imagev5":"https://s